          "bullets": [
            "ABG ปกติ: pH 7.40 (7.35–7.45), PaCO₂ 35–45 mmHg, HCO₃⁻ 22–26 mEq/L, Ratio H₂CO₃:HCO₃⁻ = 1:20 (ทนได้ pH 6.9–8.0)",
            "3 ด่านสมดุล: Chemical buffer (ทันที) → ปอด (1–2 ชม.) → ไต (12–24 ชม.)",
            "Anion Gap = [Na⁺] − ([Cl⁻] + [HCO₃⁻]) ปกติ 8–16 mEq/L (12 ± 4)",
            "NAGMA: Diarrhea, Type 2 RTA (Tetracycline/Tenofovir), CAI, K-sparing, Cholestyramine → NaHCO₃ / Shohl's solution",
            "HAGMA: DKA, Lactic (Metformin/INH/ddI), Salicylate, Ethanol, Ethylene glycol, Renal failure → keep pH ≥ 7.2",
            "NaHCO₃: 7.5% = 8.92 mEq/10 mL | 8.4% = 10 mEq/10 mL | ห้ามเพิ่ม > 4–8 mEq/L/day | Drip ใน D5W",
            "Metabolic Alkalosis: Saline-responsive (Urine Cl⁻ < 15) → 0.9% NaCl + KCl (K < 3.5) + Acetazolamide / 0.1 N HCl (≤ 0.2 mEq/kg/hr)",
            "Resp Acidosis (PaCO₂ ↑: Opioids, COPD, GBS, MG) | Resp Alkalosis (PaCO₂ ↓: Hyperventilation, Salicylate, PE → Paper bag)"
          ]
