            "<strong>KDIGO 2026 Anemia — Iron [P.30–36]:</strong> Hb &lt;13 (M) / &lt;12 (F); treat TSAT &le;30% &amp; Ferritin &le;500 (200 mg Fe/d once daily); Iron dextran needs test dose; STOP if Ferritin &gt;700 or TSAT &ge;40%",
