            "<strong>CKD-MBD &amp; Binders [P.48–64]:</strong> Chew all binders with 1st bite EXCEPT Sevelamer (swallow whole!); CaCO<sub>3</sub> 40% / Acetate 25% max 1,500 mg/d; Al(OH)<sub>3</sub> &le;4 wk (3B); Active Vit D in G5; Cinacalcet hold if Ca &lt;8.4",
            "<strong>CVD &amp; Drug Dosing [P.65–67]:</strong> Age &ge;50 + eGFR &lt;60 &rarr; Statin &plusmn; Eze; do NOT initiate statin on dialysis (4D/AURORA); Atorva 20 / Rosuva 10 max; ASA secondary prevention only; CG for NTI drugs"
