            "★ Ca²⁺ / PO₄³⁻ / Mg²⁺ [P.56–72]: Corrected Ca = Ca + 0.8(4 − Alb) | PO₄ Max 7 mmol/hr | Ca Max 1.5 mEq/min (CaCO₃ 40% > CaCl₂ 27% > Ca gluconate 9%) | Mg²⁺ < 1.0 เสี่ยง TdP"
