          "quickSummaryHtml": "<div style=\"overflow-x:auto;\"><table><thead><tr><th>หัวข้อ</th><th>สูตร / เกณฑ์วิกฤต</th><th>การจัดการ &amp; ข้อควรระวัง</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Osmolality &amp; IV Fluids</strong></td><td><code>2Na + Glu/18 + BUN/2.8</code> (280–300)<br>0.9% NaCl = 308 | D5NSS = 586 | ORS = 245</td><td>Holliday-Segar (&gt;20 kg): <code>1,500 + 20×(BW−20)</code><br>45 kg = 2,000 mL/day</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hyponatremia (&lt;135)</strong></td><td><code>Na deficit = TBW × ΔNa</code><br>3% NaCl = 513 mmol/L</td><td><strong>Max ≤ 12 mEq/day</strong> กัน CPM; SIADH: จำกัดน้ำ ± Furosemide (Goal &gt; 125)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hypernatremia (&gt;145)</strong></td><td><code>Water deficit = TBW × ([Na/140] − 1)</code></td><td>D5W / D5N/4 ลดไม่เกิน 1–2 mEq/L/hr (10–12 mEq/day)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hypokalemia (&lt;3.5)</strong></td><td>2.5–3.4: 20–40 mEq | &lt;2.5: 40–80 mEq<br>10% KCl elixir 30 mL = 40 mEq</td><td>Rate 10–20 (Max 40) mEq/hr | <strong>ห้าม IV push!</strong> Peripheral &lt; 40, Central &lt; 80 mEq/L</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hyperkalemia (&gt;5.5)</strong></td><td>EKG change → 10% Ca gluconate 10–30 mL</td><td>Shift: Insulin+Glucose, Albuterol, NaHCO₃ | ขับออก: Resin (ห้ามผสมน้ำส้ม/มะนาว)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PO₄³⁻ / Ca²⁺ / Mg²⁺</strong></td><td><code>Corr Ca = Ca + 0.8(4 − Alb)</code><br>Mg &lt; 1.0 mg/dL → เสี่ยง TdP</td><td>PO₄ Max 7 mmol/hr | Ca Max 1.5 mEq/min | HyperCa: NSS + Furosemide + Bisphosphonate</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
