            "html": "<div class=\"quick-rx-matrix\">\n  <div class=\"drug-card\">\n    <div class=\"drug-title\">\n      <h4>1. D<sub>2</sub> Antagonists (Prokinetics)</h4>\n      <span class=\"drug-class\">EPS vs QT Limit</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"drug-grid\">\n      <div class=\"grid-item\">\n        <strong>Metoclopramide [P.8]:</strong>\n        <p>ผ่าน BBB &rarr; <strong>EPS 3–5%</strong> (แก้ด้วย IV Diphenhydramine); <strong>CI: GI obstruction</strong></p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid-item\">\n        <strong>Domperidone [P.9]:</strong>\n        <p>ไม่ผ่าน BBB (No EPS); <strong>Max &le; 30 mg/day</strong> เหตุเสี่ยง <strong>QT prolongation</strong></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"drug-card\">\n    <div class=\"drug-title\">\n      <h4>2. 5-HT<sub>3</sub> Antagonists</h4>\n      <span class=\"drug-class\">CINV / Radiation / PONV</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"drug-grid\">\n      <div class=\"grid-item\">\n        <strong>Ondansetron / Palonosetron:</strong>\n        <p>บล็อก 5-HT<sub>3</sub> CTZ + Vagus; <strong>No EPS</strong>; เหนือกว่า Metoclopramide ใน CINV</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid-item\">\n        <strong>ADR &amp; Safety [P.11]:</strong>\n        <p><strong>Headache (9–27%)</strong>, ท้องผูก, AST/ALT เพิ่ม 1–5%; IV single dose &le; 16 mg</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"drug-card\">\n    <div class=\"drug-title\">\n      <h4>3. CINV (NK-1 + Steroid + Lorazepam)</h4>\n      <span class=\"drug-class\">Acute &amp; Delayed CINV</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"drug-grid\">\n      <div class=\"grid-item\">\n        <strong>HEC Regimen [P.13-14]:</strong>\n        <p><strong>Aprepitant + 5-HT<sub>3</sub> + Dexamethasone (&plusmn; Olanzapine)</strong>; Anticipatory = Lorazepam</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid-item\">\n        <strong>Aprepitant Traps [P.14-15]:</strong>\n        <p><strong>CYP3A4/2C9 inducer</strong> (ลด Dexa 50%, ระวัง Warfarin/ยาคุม); <strong>Teratogenic</strong></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"drug-card\">\n    <div class=\"drug-title\">\n      <h4>4. Motion Sickness &amp; Pregnancy (NVP)</h4>\n      <span class=\"drug-class\">Vestibular vs Cat A</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"drug-grid\">\n      <div class=\"grid-item\">\n        <strong>Motion Sickness [P.12]:</strong>\n        <p><strong>Dimenhydrinate</strong> ก่อน 30 นาที หรือ <strong>Scopolamine patch</strong> แปะหลังหูก่อน 4–6 ชม.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid-item\">\n        <strong>Morning Sickness (NVP):</strong>\n        <p>First-line: <strong>Vitamin B6 (Pyridoxine 10–25 mg TID) &plusmn; Doxylamine</strong></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
