            "html": "<div class=\"quick-rx-matrix\">\n  <div class=\"rx-header\">\n    <h4>⚡ QuickRx: PUD &amp; <em>H. pylori</em> Eradication</h4>\n    <span class=\"badge badge-info\">Thai 2015 &amp; ACG 2024</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"drug-card\">\n    <div class=\"drug-title\">\n      <h4>1. Bismuth Quadruple Therapy (14 วัน)</h4>\n      <span class=\"drug-class\">First-line ACG 2024 / Second-line Thai</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"drug-grid\">\n      <div class=\"grid-item\">\n        <strong>Regimen:</strong>\n        <p>PPI BID + Bismuth subsalicylate 525 mg (หรือ subcitrate 120–300 mg) QID + Metronidazole 400–500 mg TID/QID + Tetracycline 500 mg QID</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid-item\">\n        <strong>Counseling ★:</strong>\n        <p>Bismuth: อุจจาระ/ลิ้นดำ; Metro: ห้ามแอลกอฮอล์; Tetra: ห้ามกินกับนม/ยาลดกรด/ธาตุเหล็ก &amp; ห้ามคนท้อง/เด็ก &lt;8 ปี</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"drug-card\">\n    <div class=\"drug-title\">\n      <h4>2. Standard Triple &amp; Sequential Therapy (Thai First-line)</h4>\n      <span class=\"drug-class\">Clarithromycin-based Regimens</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"drug-grid\">\n      <div class=\"grid-item\">\n        <strong>Standard Triple (10–14 วัน):</strong>\n        <p>PPI BID + Clarithromycin 500 mg BID + Amoxicillin 1,000 mg BID (แพ้ PCN ใช้ Metronidazole 500 mg BID)</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid-item\">\n        <strong>Sequential (10 วัน):</strong>\n        <p>D1–5: PPI BID + Amox 1g BID &rarr; D6–10: PPI BID + Metro 250–500 BID + Clarithro 250–500 BID</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"drug-card\">\n    <div class=\"drug-title\">\n      <h4>3. ACG 2024 PCAB Regimens &amp; Test of Cure</h4>\n      <span class=\"drug-class\">Vonoprazan &amp; UBT Rules</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"drug-grid\">\n      <div class=\"grid-item\">\n        <strong>PCAB Dual / Triple (14 วัน):</strong>\n        <p>Vonoprazan 20 mg BID + Amox 1 g TID (Dual); หรือ + Clarithro 500 BID + Amox 1 g BID (Triple เมื่อเชื้อไว)</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid-item\">\n        <strong>UBT / SAT Washout:</strong>\n        <p>หยุด ATB/Bismuth <strong>&ge; 4 สัปดาห์</strong>, หยุด PPI <strong>&ge; 2 สัปดาห์</strong> ก่อนตรวจยืนยันผล</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"drug-card\">\n    <div class=\"drug-title\">\n      <h4>4. Uncomplicated Ulcer &amp; NSAID-Induced PUD</h4>\n      <span class=\"drug-class\">DU 4 wks vs GU 8 wks</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"drug-grid\">\n      <div class=\"grid-item\">\n        <strong>PPI Duration:</strong>\n        <p><strong>DU = 4 สัปดาห์</strong> | <strong>GU = 8 สัปดาห์</strong> (ต้อง Biopsy &amp; EGD ซ้ำ); ยังกิน NSAID ต่อต้องใช้ PPI เท่านั้น</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid-item\">\n        <strong>Prevention &amp; Misoprostol:</strong>\n        <p>Celecoxib + PPI หรือ Misoprostol 200 mcg QID (ท้องเสีย 15–30%, <strong>ห้ามเด็ดขาดในหญิงตั้งครรภ์!</strong>)</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
