          "quickRx": {
            "title": "⚡ QuickRx: UGIB (Non-Variceal, Variceal & Prevention)",
            "description": "สรุป NSAID GIxCV Matrix, SUP ICU Criteria, Forrest & IV PPI (80 mg -> 8 mg/hr), Octreotide + Ceftriaxone และ Antiplatelet Day 3",
            "html": "<div class=\"quick-rx-matrix\">\n  <div class=\"drug-card\">\n    <div class=\"drug-title\">\n      <h4>1. Resuscitation &amp; Non-Variceal IV PPI</h4>\n      <span class=\"drug-class\">Target pH &gt; 6.0 | Hb 7–8</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"drug-grid\">\n      <div class=\"grid-item\">\n        <strong>High-Dose IV PPI [P.20]:</strong>\n        <p>Omep/Panto/Eso <strong>80 mg IV bolus &rarr; 8 mg/hr x 72h</strong> (Lanso 60 &rarr; 6 mg/hr)</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid-item\">\n        <strong>Transfusion &amp; Pre-EGD:</strong>\n        <p>Restrictive PRC <strong>Hb 7–8 g/dL</strong> (ACS &ge; 9–10); <strong>Erythromycin 250 mg IV</strong> ก่อนส่องกล้อง</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"drug-card\">\n    <div class=\"drug-title\">\n      <h4>2. Variceal UGIB Protocol</h4>\n      <span class=\"drug-class\">Cirrhosis / Portal HTN</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"drug-grid\">\n      <div class=\"grid-item\">\n        <strong>Acute Bleeding:</strong>\n        <p><strong>Octreotide 50 mcg IV + 50 mcg/hr</strong> (2–5d) + <strong>Ceftriaxone 1 g IV OD</strong> (5–7d) + EVL</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid-item\">\n        <strong>Secondary Prophylaxis:</strong>\n        <p><strong>Non-selective BB (Propranolol / Carvedilol) + EVL</strong></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"drug-card\">\n    <div class=\"drug-title\">\n      <h4>3. NSAID Prevention &amp; ICU SUP</h4>\n      <span class=\"drug-class\">GI &times; CV Risk | ICU</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"drug-grid\">\n      <div class=\"grid-item\">\n        <strong>NSAID Matrix [P.9]:</strong>\n        <p>High CV: <strong>Naproxen + PPI</strong>; High GI + High CV: <strong>Avoid NSAID/COX-2i</strong></p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid-item\">\n        <strong>SUP Major [P.15-16]:</strong>\n        <p><strong>Vent &gt; 48h</strong> หรือ <strong>Coagulopathy</strong> (INR &gt; 1.5, PLT &lt; 50k) &rarr; PPI เหนือกว่า H2RA</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"drug-card\">\n    <div class=\"drug-title\">\n      <h4>4. Forrest &amp; Antiplatelet Resumption</h4>\n      <span class=\"drug-class\">Secondary CVD</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"drug-grid\">\n      <div class=\"grid-item\">\n        <strong>Forrest Stigmata [P.21]:</strong>\n        <p><strong>Ia, Ib, IIa:</strong> Dual Endoscopic + IV PPI | <strong>IIc, III:</strong> Oral PPI กลับบ้านได้</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid-item\">\n        <strong>Restart ASA [P.22]:</strong>\n        <p>Secondary ASA (High-risk): <strong>เริ่มซ้ำ Day 3</strong> | DAPT: <strong>คง ASA ต่อห้ามหยุด</strong></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
          },
