          "quickSummaryHtml": "<div style=\"overflow-x:auto;\"><table><thead><tr><th>กลุ่มยา</th><th>ระยะ / กลไกหลัก</th><th>ADR เด่น &amp; การจัดการ</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Nitrogen Mustards</strong><br>(CTX, Ifosfamide)</td><td>CCNS: Aziridinium ion จับ N(7) Guanine</td><td>Acrolein → <strong>Hemorrhagic cystitis</strong> (IFEX &gt; CTX) → Hydration + <strong>MESNA (-SH)</strong>; SIADH</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Platinum Analogs</strong><br>(Cis / Carbo / Oxali)</td><td>CCNS: Hydrolysis → Di-aqua form</td><td>Cisplatin: พิษไต/หู + N/V; Carboplatin: กดไขกระดูก (Calvert AUC 4–8); Oxaliplatin: Neuropathy</td></tr><tr><td><strong>MTX / Pemetrexed</strong></td><td>CCS (S): ยับยั้ง DHFR</td><td>MTX: <strong>Leucovorin rescue</strong>, ห้ามร่วม NSAIDs/Vit C; Pemetrexed: Pre-med <strong>Folic + B12</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>6-MP / 5-FU / Ara-C</strong></td><td>CCS (S): Purine / Pyrimidine</td><td>6-MP + Allopurinol ลดยา 50–75%; 5-FU + Leucovorin เสริมฤทธิ์; HiDAC → Cerebellar + <strong>Dexa eye drop</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Anthracyclines / Bleo / MMC</strong></td><td>CCNS (Bleo = G2-M): Intercalate + Free radical</td><td>Doxo: พิษหัวใจ (Liposomal ลดพิษ); Mitoxantrone: Blue-green; MMC: <strong>Nadir 6–8 wk</strong> + HUS; Bleo: <strong>Lung fibrosis</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Vinca vs Taxanes</strong></td><td>CCS (M): ยับยั้ง Poly vs Depoly</td><td>Vinca รั่ว: ประคบอุ่น + Hyaluronidase; Paclitaxel (Cremophor) → Pre-med; Docetaxel → Fluid retention, Beau's lines</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Etoposide / Irinotecan</strong></td><td>Topo II (G1-S) / Topo I (CCNS)</td><td>Etoposide: Hypotension (ฉีดช้า); Irinotecan: <strong>Acute diarrhea (Atropine)</strong> vs <strong>Delayed (Loperamide)</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
